, "platform": 14, "y": 2027, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1843695, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilr.jpg"}, {"id": 1843696, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ils.jpg"}, {"id": 1843697, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilt.jpg"}, {"id": 1843698, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilu.jpg"}, {"id": 1843699, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilv.jpg"}, {"id": 1843701, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilx.jpg"}, {"id": 1843702, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ily.jpg"}, {"id": 1843700, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilw.jpg"}, {"id": 1843703, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13ilz.jpg"}, {"id": 1843704, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13im0.jpg"}], "slug": "mama", "summary": "An emotional narrative point-and-click about a daughter caring for her mother as dementia reshapes their bond. Explore heartfelt conversations, fragmented memories, and story-driven puzzles on a journey of caregiving and learning to let go.\n\nLove is heavy. Care is relentless. Watching someone you love fade is a quiet, piercing heartbreak you can\u2019t prepare for. In this game, you step into the shoes of a daughter, moving through a world shaped by dementia - not to solve it, not to fix it, but to live it, feel it, and carry it alongside the one you love. Every gesture, every pause, every choice matters.\n\nGameplay isn\u2019t a distraction - it is the story. Simple, deliberate interactions and inventive puzzles put you inside moments of tenderness, confusion, and heartbreak. Seven chapters guide you through caregiving\u2019s emotional terrain: the exhausting patience, the fragile joys, and the quiet sorrow of learning when to hold on - and when to let go.\n\nDementia is at the heart of the experience, shaping every conversation, memory, and interaction. Each day reveals shifting moods and fractured recollections, blurring the line between truth and misremembering. As the mother\u2019s world becomes more fragile and uncertain, the gameplay mirrors her fading clarity \u2014 guiding you through moments of confusion, tenderness, and the quiet heartbreak of watching someone slip away.", "themes": [{"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mama", "videos": [{"id": 190731, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gtvw0mSnU-U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gtvw0mSnU-U", "title": "Mama - Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gtvw0mSnU-U/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185854, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NB9w8ZlxpvM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NB9w8ZlxpvM", "title": "Mama - Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NB9w8ZlxpvM/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185855, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ixCXdDfUnAk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ixCXdDfUnAk", "title": "Mama  - Official Trailer  - High Resolution", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ixCXdDfUnAk/sddefault.jpg"}]}